# Build output and the per-project Gradle cache. The repository root already ignores
# `build/` and `.gradle`, but naming them here keeps the module's boundaries obvious to
# anyone reading just this directory.
build/
.gradle/

# Scratch produced by local runs of the jar (index, preview segments, waveforms).
cache/
out/

# Local deployment for this specific host: it hardcodes the paths, ports and ssh target
# of one machine, so it stays out of the repository. README.md documents the same steps
# generically for anyone else.
deploy.sh
